{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15528","headline":"奉送杜中丞赴洪州 · 畅当","name":"奉送杜中丞赴洪州","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"诏出凤凰宫，新恩连帅雄。\n江湖经战阵，草木待仁风。\n豪右贪威爱，纡繁德简通。\n多慙君子顾，攀饯路尘中。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"畅当","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_15528.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15528","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}